  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Carnival 2012 Autumn was held at Access Sapporo on 4 November, Intex Osaka on 17 November and Tokyo Big Sight on 23 and 24 November 2012. Its main tournament, Victory Cup 2012, was played in a junior and an open league through the same Challenge, Premier and Climax stages as the spring, and everyone who entered got Landorus and Tympole stamped with the event's logo. The top three of each league won Victory Cup in the print for their place, in an acrylic shield. On the last day in Tokyo, the event also held a Last Chance Qualifier and the Victory Cup 2012 Japan National Championship.",
